# The tier-1 qualification digest hashes these files byte for byte, so a
# reviewer has to be able to recompute it. This machine runs core.autocrlf=true
# and there was no .gitattributes, so a checkout rewrote LF to CRLF and the
# digest moved without any content changing. Pin the hashed inputs to LF so the
# certificate depends on what the files say, not on how they were checked out.
.agents/skills/helix-section-agent/** text eol=lf
skills/helix-evidence-pipeline/contracts/** text eol=lf
skills/helix-evidence-pipeline/packages/** text eol=lf
scripts/*.mjs text eol=lf
scripts/lib/*.mjs text eol=lf
azure-pipelines.yml text eol=lf
